, I tell you!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00569_1/uni00569_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"ふうまちゃんはまだ学生なんだから、私に敬語を使ってもいいんだよ？　なんなら蛇子様って呼んでもいいんだから♪","en":"Fuuma-chan, you're still a student, so you can use polite language with me if you want. You can even call me Hebiko-sama if you like."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00569_1/uni00569_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ふふ、あの頃は大人っぽく見えることもあったふうまちゃんだけど、今は蛇子の方が大人なんだな～って","en":"Hehe, back then, Fuuma-chan sometimes looked like an adult, but now I'm the one who looks more grown-up."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00569_1/uni00569_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"また、独立遊撃隊でふうまちゃんと鹿之助ちゃんと一緒に任務かぁ……懐かしいね♪","en":"We're going on a mission with Fuuma-chan and Shikanosuke-chan from the independent strike team again... it's nostalgic."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00569_1/uni00569_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ふうまちゃんは独立遊撃隊の隊長だけど、私も“Ｂａｎｄｉｔ”の隊長を務めていたんだよ","en":"Fuuma-chan is the captain of the independent strike team, but I was also the captain of \"Bandit\"."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00569_1/uni00569_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"この力が目ざめた時の事は思い出したくないけど……今は、ふうまちゃんの為に使えるのが嬉しいな","en":"I don't want to remember what happened when I first awakened to this power... but now, I'm happy I can use it for Fuuma-chan's sake."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00569_1/uni00569_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ああ、だめぇ見ないでぇ……こんな姿見られたくないのぉっ……！","en":"Ah, no, don't look... I don't want you to see me like this..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00569_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"んぅ、あぁ、ヌルヌルがすごいぃ……ふぁっ、やぁ、おマンコ疼いて来ちゃうぅっ","en":"Mmm, it feels so good... it's all slippery... ah, my pussy is getting all tingly..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r1